{
    "name": "1inch",
    "description": "DEX aggregator that sources liquidity across on-chain venues to route swaps at optimal rates, alongside a gasless, intent-based Limit Order Protocol — both ship in the 1inch Aggregation Router v6 on Monad. 1inch also deploys Aqua, its self-custodial shared liquidity layer, together with the on-chain SwapVM execution engine that settles against it.",
    "live": true,
    "categories": [
        "DeFi::DEX Aggregator",
        "DeFi::DEX",
        "DeFi::Intents",
        "DeFi::Trading Interfaces"
